abstract: >-
  Code and exact certificates for FC(4,9) = 16, a lexicographic
  counterexample, the common-pair classification on nine points,
  and additional finite lower bounds. The README gives requirements,
  verification commands, expected outputs and the correspondence
  with manuscript version V1.
